{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/d127fe9300fba1cfa98158661285b4e7.avif?t=1773738340\" width=392 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash through enemies and obstacles to carve the optimal route through each level.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through guards, walls, and breakable objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open up faster paths by smashing your way forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance destruction with speed to maximise your score</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/077850b85eb4a9823d9d385e5b3fa4ae.poster.avif?t=1773738340\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/077850b85eb4a9823d9d385e5b3fa4ae.webm?t=1773738340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/077850b85eb4a9823d9d385e5b3fa4ae.mp4?t=1773738340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/dec91add0c7c2c324d75e0404eb7256d.avif?t=1773738340\" width=392 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab everything in sight, including loot, diamonds and even enemies, and use them to your advantage.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snatch loot, valuables, and hidden diamonds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw enemies and objects to create chaos or clear a path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use clever grabs to uncover shortcuts and boost your run</p